======================================================================
1. DEFINITIVE STUDY QUESTION
======================================================================

The primary computational question is:

How does progressive reduction in gravitational loading alter
patient-specific ventricular mechanical behavior?

The definitive mechanical response sequence is:

Patient-specific cardiac imaging
        ->
Patient-specific ventricular geometry
        ->
Finite-element solid-mechanics model
        ->
Myocardial stress
        ->
Myocardial strain
        ->
Ventricular displacement
        ->
LV cavity volume
        ->
Myocardial volume
        ->
Strain energy
        ->
Gravity-dependent response
        ->
Sensitivity/robustness assessment


