9. GROUP-LEVEL SUMMARY
======================================================================

For each gravity condition and each endpoint, the primary descriptive
summary should be calculated across the available patient-level
computational subjects.

Preferred reporting format:

Mean ± SD

where SD represents between-patient variation for the corresponding
patient-level simulation outputs.

The number of contributing patient-level simulations must always be
reported or recoverable.

No group-level mean or SD should be generated independently of the
patient-level records.


